WEBVTT

00:03:58.716 --> 00:04:00.076
The ratings were quite high.

00:04:00.116 --> 00:04:01.676
People were worried.

00:04:02.476 --> 00:04:05.796
But if we first asked them,
"Do you have a gas mask?"

00:04:06.516 --> 00:04:09.516
then the ratings dropped dramatically.

00:04:10.036 --> 00:04:12.116
And that's magic.

00:04:12.116 --> 00:04:16.436
Apart from the fact
that gas masks are largely useless

00:04:16.436 --> 00:04:19.316
against weapons of mass destruction,

00:04:19.356 --> 00:04:24.236
the fact that you have a gas mask
is unlikely to affect the strategic

00:04:24.236 --> 00:04:29.196
or the tactical decision
of a foreign power.